      <h2 id="sources">Sources and scope</h2>
      <p>This guide is written primarily for people starting a community badminton club in England. The operating principles (venue, capacity, fees, player retention and rotation) travel well, but affiliation, insurance, safeguarding and governance requirements vary by country and by the type of organisation. Check the rules that apply where you are.</p>
